    ],
    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "object-pronouns",
        "title": "Me, you, him",
        "body": [
          "Kiswahili huweka “mimi” na “wewe” ndani ya kitenzi (**ni-ta-ku-pigia**). Kiingereza huyaweka **baada** ya kitenzi: **I’ll call you**, **Call me**.",
          "Maneno hayo ni: **me, you, him, her, it, us, them**. **Nitampigia** ni **I’ll call him** au **I’ll call her**."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Kuanza simu",
        "body": [
          "Kwenye simu, Kiingereza husema **Hello?** kisha **This is Amani** (ni Amani), si “I am Amani”. Kuuliza mtu: **Can I speak to Juma, please?**"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
